          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 159
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Strict: chosen apps are quit when a session starts, quit again if you open them, and reopened when it ends. Apps with unsaved work may ask before closing.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 24,
          "startingLine": 162
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Chosen apps are hidden when a session starts, hidden again if you switch to them, and shown again when it ends.",
